WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.940
NES Play-Action Football, real pro-action in the NES Power Bowl.

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:30.520
NEStalgia And welcome to NEStalgia, a chronological exploration of every NES game released in North America.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.480
I'm Mike. I'm Sean.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.540
And today we are playing a game that has NES in the title.

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.620
Have we gone meta?

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:43.660
I think we've been really hyping this up, the whole NES, NES.

00:00:44.180 --> 00:00:46.520
