00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.280
Yeah, that's cool. Uh, which is fun.

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:37.220
And, uh, even the, the players have their, uh, hut, hut, hut.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.440
