00:12:44.620 --> 00:12:46.380
huts, uh, which is true.

00:12:46.980 --> 00:12:49.880
But, uh, you know, you were mentioning the playbook.

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:55.380
And I think also that what I like about the playbook is the, um, efficiency of it all too.

00:12:55.520 --> 00:13:02.080
